      "selected_lines": [
        {
          "line": 135,
          "text": "## Durability/platform limits and follow-up constraints"
        },
        {
          "line": 136,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 137,
          "text": "File-fsync precedes replacement. Directory metadata is not fsynced. Atomic"
        },
        {
          "line": 138,
          "text": "replacement is not a universal power-loss guarantee; network/filesystem"
        },
        {
          "line": 139,
          "text": "semantics and storage can differ. Windows requires staging closure before"
        },
        {
          "line": 140,
          "text": "replacement, which the implementation does, but readers/antivirus holding the"
        },
        {
          "line": 141,
          "text": "destination can prevent replacement; that error propagates. POSIX modes do not"
        },
        {
          "line": 142,
          "text": "establish a Windows ACL guarantee. Actual power cuts, disk-full hardware,"
        },
        {
          "line": 143,
          "text": "Windows/frozen builds, browser interaction, network filesystems, GPU models,"
        },
        {
          "line": 144,
          "text": "TLS/production WSGI, and audible output were not tested."
        },
        {
          "line": 145,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 146,
          "text": "`docker info --format '{{.ServerVersion}}'` failed with permission denied on"
        },
        {
          "line": 147,
          "text": "`/var/run/docker.sock`; no CPU/Intel/CUDA image builds ran. Full Docker builds"
        },
        {
          "line": 148,
          "text": "would also require model-fetching layers excluded from this task. No Windows"
        },
        {
          "line": 149,
          "text": "runtime or PyInstaller executable is available here. The Docker copy edits and"
        },
        {
          "line": 150,
          "text": "static imports are included, but their platform builds remain unverified."
        }
      ]
    },
